<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Product collateral, workforce insights, and legal and privacy information from ZKTeco WFM."/><title>Resources | ZKTeco WFM</title><link href="assets/tailwind.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/assets/site-enhancements.css?v=keytitles-v126" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="assets/privacy.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="assets/layout-standard-v114.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body class="zk-page">
