<main><section class="zk-resource-intro"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">Resources</div><h1>Find What You Need.</h1><p>Product documents, practical insights, important policies—organized in three clear destinations.</p></div></section><section class="zk-resource-directory"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-directory-grid"><a class="zk-directory-card zk-directory-product" href="product-collaterals"><span class="zk-directory-num">01</span><span class="zk-directory-icon">PC</span><h2>Product Collaterals</h2><p>Data sheets, installation guides, user manuals, and approved product images for ZKTeco WFM solutions.</p><span class="zk-directory-link">Find product resources <b>→</b></span></a><a class="zk-directory-card" href="thought-leadership"><span class="zk-directory-num">02</span><span class="zk-directory-icon">TL</span><h2>Thought Leadership</h2><p>Practical perspectives on workforce data collection, Workday, time clocks, integrations, and operations.</p><span class="zk-directory-link">Explore insights <b>→</b></span></a><a class="zk-directory-card" href="legal-privacy"><span class="zk-directory-num">03</span><span class="zk-directory-icon">LP</span><h2>Legal &amp; Privacy</h2><p>Privacy, terms, accessibility, security, and compliance information in one straightforward location.</p><span class="zk-directory-link">View legal &amp; privacy <b>→</b></span></a></div></div></section><section class="zk-resource-cta"><div class="zk-wrap"><div><div class="zk-eyebrow">Need Assistance?</div><h2>Looking for a specific resource?</h2><p>Our team can direct you to the right product document or support path.</p></div><a class="zk-btn primary" href="contact">Ask an Expert</a></div></section></main>
<Footer /><script is:inline src="assets/privacy.js"></script></body></html>
